                                "sense_id": "bcb4766b-8435-3af6-8ef4-f61f6acf8fb6",
                                "text": "\"Hear, hear,\" and Joanna passed out of the conversation, for who was going to waste time either taking up or taking down a silly, tedious, foreign, unsensible notion like ploughing grass?..."
